cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use BioPhasor in your research, please cite it as follows.
title: "BioPhasor: Phasor Dynamics Library for Multi-Omics Data"
abstract: >
  BioPhasor is a Python library for phasor-based omics analysis and
  multi-omics integration. It encodes biological measurements as complex
  numbers on the unit circle, enabling circular statistics, phase coherence
  analysis, and oscillatory dynamics for genomics, transcriptomics,
  proteomics, and metabolomics data.
authors:
  - name: "Quantum Omics Foundation"
    website: "https://github.com/quantum-omics-foundation"
